<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>Value::vector_add</computeroutput> / <computeroutput>dot_product</computeroutput> / <computeroutput>matrix_multiply</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>对应的 <computeroutput>*_checked</computeroutput> 方法并传播维度或输入错误  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>SymbolicExpr::get_type</computeroutput> 与嵌套 <computeroutput>Type</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>具体 predicate 或 <computeroutput>expr_match</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>SymbolicExpr::get_operands</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>公开变换与 matching API  </para>
</entry></row>
