<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>SymbolicExpr::get_number_value</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>is_number</computeroutput> + <computeroutput>get_number</computeroutput>，或 <computeroutput>evaluate_numeric</computeroutput>  </para>
